WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.770
When it attacks, it gains 400 attack points.

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:14.990
When it destroys a monster, 
its stats decrease.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:30.050
Yusei and Kiryu are finally 
going to settle things.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.510
Is Yusei okay?

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.480
Yusei will definitely win.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.560
You came, Yusei!

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:04.280
Kiryu!

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:13.490
It's finally time to finish Team 
Satisfaction's last duel that we started long ago!

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.220
Last duel…

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:21.430
We're all here!

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:27.650
This will be Team Satisfaction's last duel!

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:31.570
Duel and capture them!

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:37.140
Where are you, Kiryu?

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:54.230
Kiryu!

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:00.300
Yusei!

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:12.910
Yusei!

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:17.850
You betrayed me!  You sold me out!

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:19.740
You're wrong, Kiryu!

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:23.790
Yusei!

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:26.320
Kiryu…

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.600
Let's begin.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:52.670
Looking over a vast distance

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:57.770
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:02.680
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:07.450
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:12.810
No matter how bad today is

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:17.790
There's still the faintest light

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:23.200
All I have to do tomorrow

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:27.260
Is light it myself

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:32.270
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:37.240
Even if I get countless scars

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:43.540
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:47.520
Today will never exist again

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:53.420
So I won't stop or vanish

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:22.760
Last Duel!
Team Satisfaction

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:25.910
There it is.

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:29.380
Yusei!  Kiryu!

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:47.640
It's the last duel, Yusei!

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:02.050
It's starting.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:10.200
Kiryu and Yusei...

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.460
Let's go, Yusei.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:19.700
I've returned from the edge of death 
to kick you into the fires of revenge.

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:22.170
By using the power of Earthbound Immortal!

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:26.170
Kiryu, you were never like this.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:30.170
You cared about us more than anyone else.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:39.280
Kiryu, it's fine!  Let go!

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.820
Or else, you'll also-

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.100
No way!

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:46.430
I will not forsake you!

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:49.060
You're my friend!

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:50.270
That's right.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:53.350
That's why I'll save you in this duel.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:10.250
Yusei, you still haven't given up on Kiryu.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:14.690
Field Spell Speed World set on!

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:16.050
Duel Mode on.

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:17.520
Duel!

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:25.550
Whoever takes the first corner 
gets to decide who goes first.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:32.290
His D-Wheel is more powerful than before.

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.870
But I won't let you beat me!

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:41.610
I'll go first, Yusei!

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:44.560
My turn!

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:48.530
I summon Infernity Necromancer from my hand.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:54.460
It's an Infernity monster.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:58.030
Is he going to use his handless combo again?

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:01.400
I set one card and end my turn.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.200
Bring it, Yusei!

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:08.390
In this duel, I'll make 
you pay for betraying me!

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:09.610
My turn!

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:20.570
Kiryu, I remember the moment when we 
started heading our separate ways.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:27.060
We achieved our goal of conquering Satellite.

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:33.440
We were burnt out and looking 
for what to do next.

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:39.900
But Kiryu didn't want to acknowledge 
that the party was over.

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:43.640
He was on the streets looking for enemies.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:48.010
Today, we will hunt Team 
Insect in F District.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:50.840
We haven't finished conquering Satellite.

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:53.880
Everyone who has a Duel Disk is our enemy!

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:09.860
That's far enough!

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.610
Are you ready?

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:24.210
Crow?

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:36.690
Go home.

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.830
I said leave!

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:51.590
Crow…

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:55.740
Is dueling supposed to be this meaningless?

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:11.130
Never enter the dueling world half-heartedly!

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.160
Stop!

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:15.890
Hurry up and leave!

00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:18.100
What are you doing, Crow?

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.050
Hurry up and go!

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:22.720
Stop it, Crow and Kiryu!

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:23.600
You…

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:29.610
Let me go, Yusei!  I can't stand it anymore!

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:35.370
Dueling is supposed to be fun 
against anyone, anywhere, anytime!

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:39.050
Do any of us have the 
right to take that away?

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:40.220
What?

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:42.230
I'm leaving the team.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.160
Crow…

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.400
We're supposed to be a team!

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:49.130
Hey, Crow!

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:51.550
I thought we were friends!

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:53.100
Jack?

00:09:53.310 --> 00:09:56.070
Hey!  Jack!  Crow!

00:09:56.460 --> 00:10:01.460
Yusei, we're a team, right?  
We're friends, right?

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:07.410
Crow and Jack left Kiryu.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:13.260
But I wasn't able to abandon him.

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:15.530
Because he's a friend.

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:17.730
Hurry up, traitor!

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:20.190
I summon Max Warrior!

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:28.640
Max Warrior attacks Infernity Necromancer!

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:35.350
Kiryu, I'll turn you back 
to normal in this duel!

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:52.160
Have you lost your mind, Yusei?

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:57.740
Infernity Necromancer's defense points are 
greater than Max Warrior's attack points.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:00.600
Max Warrior's monster effect activates!

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:05.640
When this card attacks, it 
gains 400 attack points!

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.110
Swift Rush!

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:19.230
But Max Warrior's attack points, defense 
points and Level become half until the next turn.

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:26.410
I stayed by your side 
because we were friends.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.710
However...

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:43.250
So that's a D-Wheel.

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:47.820
Yeah.  Security is deploying 
a lot of them this time.

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:52.850
Show the duel gangs the power of the D-Wheel!

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.890
Deal justice through dueling!

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:55.830
Roger!

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:08.240
Stop resisting!  You're like 
a rat trapped in a cage!

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.880
Damn!  I summon Skull Knight #2!

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:16.880
You fool.  I summon Assault Dog!

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:24.050
Help me!

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:28.040
What?  You want to defeat Security?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:33.580
Yeah.  I finally found Team 
Satisfaction's final opponent.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:35.240
Final opponent?

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:40.060
By defeating them, we will 
truly conquer Satellite.

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:44.470
Yusei, bring back Jack and Crow.

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:47.110
The four of us will crush them!

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:50.680
Kiryu, don't you understand 
that this is a suicide mission?

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.920
Are you scared, Yusei?

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:54.660
Kiryu!

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:01.270
Kiryu, I can't stay with you anymore.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.200
If you're going to do 
this, do it by yourself.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:07.440
I'm leaving the team.  I'm leaving you.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:08.700
Yusei!

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:16.660
I thought that if Kiryu was alone, 
he wouldn't take on Security.

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:19.370
That's why I said what I said.

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:39.070
But he lost it.

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:46.090
I activate my trap!

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:52.310
The duel is starting!

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:01.220
Entertain me!

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:03.500
I summon this.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:04.790
Crow!

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:07.890
Big trouble!  Kiryu attacked Security!

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:09.360
What?

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:18.760
Jack!

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:32.920
Where are you, Kiryu?

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:40.980
We know you're there!  
Come out and surrender!

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:52.190
What was that?

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:21.830
I knew it!

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:25.840
You're my friends!  We're Team Satisfaction!

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:30.310
Kiryu, why are you doing something so stupid?

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:32.100
We came here to stop you.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.510
We've all together!

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:41.760
This will be Team Satisfaction's last duel!

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:47.900
Kiryu…

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:55.170
That's right.  I…  We came to save you.

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:58.910
But I made the wrong choice last time.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:03.340
That's why I'll save you this time!

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:08.890
Just like how you saved me.

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:15.090
Yusei…

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:20.060
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.040
My turn!

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:25.360
I set one card.

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:28.870
Next, I flip over my trap card Limit Impulse!

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:34.250
I send two cards in my hand to the graveyard 
to Special Summon two Soul Tokens.

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:41.240
I tribute two Soul Tokens to Tribute 
Summon Dark Tuner Nightmare Hand!

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:48.580
He's setting up his handless combo.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.350
He has one card left in his hand.

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:57.580
Due to Nightmare Hand's monster effect, I 
Special Summon a Level 2 monster from my hand.

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:02.530
Come, Infernity Dwarf!

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:09.540
He has zero cards in his hand!

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:20.270
Level 10 Dark Tuner Nightmare Hand 
dark tunes Level 2 Infernity Dwarf!

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:27.560
When absolute darkness descends, 
the eyes of the afterlife open!

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:30.470
Shadows, descend!

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.300
Dark Synchro!

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:37.050
Come, Hundred-Eyes Dragon!

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:46.390
It's that monster again.

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:53.380
My handless combo is now complete!

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:57.120
Yusei, your Max Warrior 
has 900 attack points.

00:17:57.120 --> 00:18:02.010
I'll kill you!  Hundred-Eyes 
Dragon attacks Max Warrior!

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.080
Infinity Sight Stream!

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:14.530
Yusei instantly lost over 
half his life points.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.580
He also has 0 Speed Counters.

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:17.570
Yusei!

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:21.580
How's that?  Isn't the 
pain incredible, Yusei?

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.040
I activate my trap Revival Ticket!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:28.270
For every monster that was destroyed 
in battle, I destroy one card

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:32.470
on my field to regain life points 
equal to the battle damage I received!

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:37.040
Next, I can Special Summon all monsters 
that were destroyed in battle.

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:38.830
Come, Max Warrior!

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:42.500
What?

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:43.710
I'm not done!

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:46.860
Due to the effect of Limiter 
Overload that was just destroyed,

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:51.140
I can Special Summon Speed Warrior 
from my hand, deck or graveyard!

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:57.010
Yusei is incredible!

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:59.730
He turned back Kiryu's attack.

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:02.310
Why won't you die, traitor!

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:06.960
Still, you can't do anything 
against Hundred-Eyes Dragon!

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:08.320
My turn!

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:13.500
It's true that Speed Warrior and Max Warrior

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:16.900
don't have as many attack 
points as Hundred-Eyes Dragon.

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:19.900
And I don't have any cards to stop it.

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:21.450
In that case...

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:24.370
I flip over my trap card Card of Sacrifice!

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:32.180
When the total attack points of my attack position 
monsters are less than your monster's attack points,

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:33.850
I can draw two cards!

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:38.470
And this turn, I can't summon or 
switch monsters' battle positions!

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:43.510
You can't do anything, 
Yusei.  You're pathetic.

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:47.410
Even if I add Speed Warrior and Max 
Warrior's attack points together...

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:50.100
...it's still less than Hundred-Eyes 
Dragon's attack points.

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:52.100
I draw two cards.

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:54.100
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:56.290
My turn!

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:00.210
I set one card.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:03.180
Hundred-Eyes Dragon's effect activates!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:06.650
It gains the effect of a Dark 
Attribute monster in my graveyard.

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:10.860
I activate Infernity Necromancer's 
effect that's in my graveyard.

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:12.620
When I have no cards in my hand,

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:18.510
I can Special Summon one Level 4-or-below 
Infernity monster in my graveyard.

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:20.700
I summon Infernity Archfiend!

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:26.070
I flip over my trap card Slip Summon!

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:29.540
I can activate it when my 
opponent summons a monster.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:34.880
From my hand, I can Special Summon one Level 
4-or-below monster in defense position!

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:37.460
I summon Ghost Gardna!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.280
Resistance is futile!

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:47.370
I'll show you how dangerous 
my handless combo is!

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:49.230
Hundred-Eyes Dragon!

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:51.900
Annihilate Speed Warrior!

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:54.480
Infinity Sight Stream!

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:57.980
Ghost Gardna's effect activates!

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:03.970
When a card on my field is the target of 
attack, I can switch the target to this card!

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:05.980
Stop being sneaky!

00:21:06.190 --> 00:21:11.820
Due to Hundred-Eyes Dragon's effect, it gains 
the effect of Infernity Dwarf in my graveyard!

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:17.990
When I have no cards in my hand and 
your monster is in defense position...

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:21.160
...if my attacking monster's 
attack points are greater than

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:24.160
your monster's defense points, you 
take the difference as damage!

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.390
Yusei, don't give up yet!

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:43.800
It's still not enough to extinguish 
my desire for revenge!

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:45.550
It's not enough!

00:21:57.680 --> 00:22:02.150
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.510 --> 00:22:07.220
We will build our own future

00:22:07.690 --> 00:22:12.660
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:17.830
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.430 --> 00:22:32.970
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:38.540
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.610 --> 00:22:43.250
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:48.520
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:52.990
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.190 --> 00:22:58.570
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.700 --> 00:23:03.450
This journey has no end

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:08.910
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:09.340 --> 00:23:14.150
Hear my voice
